      "field": "tactical_tips",
      "content": "Di Renjie gak punya dash, assassin gampang bunuh dia. Tank yang kena ult-nya kehilangan armor dan magic resist, jadi ati-ati nerima damage."
    },
    {
      "source": "HoKStats",
      "url": "https://hokstats.gg/heroes/di-renjie/",
      "field": "guide",
      "content": {
        "skills": [
          {
            "name": "Swift Justice",
            "description": "Each Basic Attack stacks Swift Justice (up to 5 stacks), with each stack increasing his Attack Speed and Movement Speed.",
            "type": "passive"
          },
          {
            "name": "Respect the Law",
            "description": "Throws tokens in a cone-shaped area, dealing physical damage and magical damage. Passive: After every two Basic Attacks, the next Basic Attack gains a random enhanced effect.",
            "type": "skill1"
          },
          {
            "name": "Legal Immunity",
            "description": "Throws tokens to damage nearby enemies. Removes debuffs from himself and gains brief invincibility.",
            "type": "skill2"
          },
          {
            "name": "Imperial Order",
            "description": "Throws a token in the target direction, damaging, stunning, and reducing the Physical and Magical Defense of the first enemy hero hit.",
            "type": "ultimate"
          }
        ],
        "pick_when": [
          "The enemy team plays dive comp, giving you space to poke before they engage",
          "The enemy team has front-line targets that Di Renjie can chip down with sustained ranged damage",
          "The enemy draft includes Mai Shiranui, Ukyo Tachibana, and Ying, who appear in counter data as matchups Di Renjie can pressure."
        ],
        "avoid_when": [
          "The enemy has hard engage that closes distance through poke patterns",
          "The game is decided early before the marksman can hit core item spikes",
          "A stronger pick in the same role is open and the matchup does not specifically reward Di Renjie's Ranged Harass."
        ],
        "power_spikes": [
          "Early game: farm safely behind the support, surviving lane phase to reach the marksman scaling window.",
          "Mana sustain online: poke patterns become repeatable once cooldown reduction and mana regen items come online",
          "Late game: with full damage online, sustained DPS outpaces enemy healing in extended fights."
        ],
        "common_mistakes": [
          "Spending mana on poke that does not threaten kills, leaving you empty for the actual fight.",
          "Auto-attacking instead of repositioning when the enemy assassin is missing — losing the marksman loses the fight.",
          "Engaging without checking enemy summoner-spell cooldowns, which often decide whether Di Renjie's commit reaches the target alive.",
          "Auto-attacking through enemy dive instead of repositioning — losing the marksman in early fights collapses the late-game win condition."
        ],
